0 // Footprint: 24 x 4 studs (x 0..480, z -40..40). Height 272 LDU.
0 // Lower tier: 4 corbelled round-headed arches (4 studs wide, 4 bricks tall)
0 // Upper tier: 6 smaller corbelled arches
0 // Top: water channel with two side walls and trans-blue water
0 // All pieces orthogonal, tiled on the stud grid, no overlaps.
